        "cooked": "<p><em>Inspiring Presence </em>nominees:</p><ul>\n<li>Ironic (maybe not as prolific a poster as some, but they always bring something interesting to the threads at hand)</li>\n<li>Jagarciao (always friendly and social)</li>\n<li>BlueHairedMeerkat (Constant work on awesome forum-based games)</li>\n<li>phantaskippy (Relentless creation of excellent PBF games)</li>\n<li>Alex (1000 Blank White cards is definitely a fun community game to watch)</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Bolster Allies </em>nominees:</p><ul>\n<li>grysqrl (I crack up every time I see their avatar)</li>\n<li>Silverleaf</li>\n<li>Matchstickman (Funnyness? Funniness? Funneeeness? Uh, humor)</li>\n<li>Ronway</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Truth Seeker </em>nominees:</p><ul>\n<li>Ronway (always quick on the draw to answer questions, and right more times than wrong, he is one of the most dependable members around for story/rules questions)</li>\n<li>Matchstickman</li>\n<li>McBehrer (I might not always agree with him but he's there to help)</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Harmony </em>nominees:</p><ul>\n<li>Phantaskippy (he is my favorite sparing partner for rules debates, and he gets my nod for this catagory)</li>\n<li>Foote</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Exceeded Expectations </em>nominees:</p><ul>\n<li>Spiff (He has made sooo many SotM related things and his FAQ is a staple of the boards. There's no one better for top contributor)</li>\n<li>Pydro</li>\n<li>Mezike (Responsible for the Google Hangouts tracking spreadsheet)</li>\n<li>jagarciao</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Bring What You Need </em>nominees:</p><ul><li>Lynkfox (wiki master. nuff said)</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Unique Capabilities </em>nominees:</p><ul>\n<li>Silverleaf (her crochet sentinels characters are too awesome not to mention, her Sentinels of the Crochetverse are amazing)</li>\n<li>Reckless (Because Crochet-bot cannot run unopposed; also, awesome perlers)</li>\n<li>Julia (Lego &amp; Sentinels? What kind of awesome wizardry is this!)</li>\n</ul>",
